{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"salted_fish_barrel","model_identifier":"salted_fish_barrel","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## salted_fish_barrel\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 15 (6 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.1..4.1, y -3.0..9.0, z -8.1..0.1 (size 8.2 x 12.0 x 8.2 u = 23 x 34 x 23 cm).\nSalted fish barrel: a small iron-hooped barrel (~25 cm) packed with salt, three silver fish tails, each with a forked fin (two cubes), sticking up out of the brine. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## salted_fish_barrel\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 15 (6 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.1..4.1, y -3.0..9.0, z -8.1..0.1 (size 8.2 x 12.0 x 8.2 u = 23 x 34 x 23 cm).\nSalted fish barrel: a small iron-hooped barrel (~25 cm) packed with salt, three silver fish tails, each with a forked fin (two cubes), sticking up out of the brine. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,-3.0,-7.5],"to":[3.5,5.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,0,43.0,8.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[43,0,50.0,8.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[50,0,57.0,8.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[57,0,64.0,8.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,9,7.0,16.0],"texture":0},"do